{"aarav_03": {"who": "Aarav", "text": "चुप! हम दस बचे हैं, Kabir... और दस ही रहेंगे।", "dir": "Gussa nahi, dard. \"Kabir...\" par aawaz tootti hai.", "dur": 4.53, "mouth": "XXXXGDDCBXXXCBXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXBCEECXXXXCCGDCGXEDCBDDDDDDDGGBXXXXCCBECCCDDDDGXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXBDDDDCBXXXXXDDCCGGGGGDDDDDCCDDEBGGGXXXXXXX"}, "zoya_01": {"who": "Zoya", "text": "बस... अब हिलना मत। एक दिन आराम।", "dur": 3.93, "mouth": "XXBBXXCEEDDCGGGGGGGXXXXXXXXXXXXXXDDDEBBBXXGDDDDDDDDDEEECBXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXCDDDDDCXBBXXDDCEEBXXXGCCCCCCCCCCEBXXXXXXXX"}, "kabir_06": {"who": "Kabir", "text": "धीरे... ये पैर अभी भी मेरा ही है।", "dir": "Dard mein mazaak.", "dur": 4.53, "mouth": "XXXXCDDDGGGGGGGGGGGGGGGXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXGCDDDCBBBDDDDDDDCCXXXXGDDECDDCCCDGCCCBBGGGGCDDDDGGGGGGGGGGGGGXXXXXXXXXXXXXXBGDDDCCCBBXXXXXXXXXX"}, "zoya_06": {"who": "Zoya", "text": "मेरा छोटा भाई... उस दिन मेरा हाथ पकड़े था।", "dir": "Kaanpti, dheemi. Kalai dekhte hue.", "dur": 4.1, "mouth": "XXXXXXXXXEEEDCGGDCGGGGGCCEXXDDDEBDCCCCDDCGXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXCDGGXXXDDBBBEDDDDDDGGGGGCCCCCXXXXXDCXBDDDDDXBGGCBBXXXXXX"}, "zoya_07": {"who": "Zoya", "text": "भीड़ में छूट गया। मैं doctor बनने वाली थी... और उसे बचा नहीं पाई।", "dir": "Aansu bahte hain. \"बचा नहीं पाई\" toot kar.", "dur": 6.37, "mouth": "XXXXXGGXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXBCCBEEECBBBBBBBXXGGGBXCCCXXXXXDDCCCBXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXGGXXXXBDDCXXXDDDDXXXXBDDDCBDDDBEEDDCCDDDCCCCBXXGGBBXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXCCBBBBXGGDBBXDCBXGGCCCBECCCCEBXXXDCCBBBXXXX"}, "zoya_15": {"who": "Zoya", "text": "तुम... ज़िंदा हो!", "dir": "Ro-te hue hasi.", "dur": 3.67, "mouth": "XXXXXXGGGXXXXXXXXXXXXBCDXXXXXCBXXXXXGGGGGGXXXXXXXXGDCBDDCBBXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXBBXXCDDBBBBBDDDDDDDDDDDDDBBXXXXXX"}}